---
kind: quest
id: skerry.tobias
title: The Guillemot
---

<quest id="clearName" title="Clear Tobias Crane's name" tier="run">
  <objective id="rope" title="Look at the Guillemot's rope" done="entry.mooringRope.read"/>
  <objective id="alibi" title="Find someone who can place Tobias ashore" done="holds(cleared(tobias))"/>
  <on event="questComplete">
    @tobias{when="holds(present(tobias, _))"}: Hollis told me. You'll put it in the report? That she broke her own rope?
    @inspector{mono}: Crane's name is clear. It will be in the report.
  </on>
</quest>
